# the links: the drums into the voices. SEQ again from Drums: the Links page (the amounts); SEL + SEQ
# turns them on and off (no sequencer for that hold); stored with the piece
wait 500
expect par77 0
tap SEQ
expect view 14
tap SEQ
expect view 15
shot links_off.png
press SEL
tap SEQ
release SEL
expect par77 1
expect view 15
expect edited 1
wait 2000
shot links_on.png
# the amounts: kick 50, snare 40, hats 50, perc clock off
expect par78 50
expect par79 40
expect par80 50
expect par81 0
spin K4 1
expect par81 1
spin K1 30
expect par78 80
# SEL + SEQ again: off, the amounts kept
press SEL
tap SEQ
release SEL
expect par77 0
expect par78 80
# SEQ held without SEL: still the sequencer
press SEQ
wait 500
release SEQ
expect view 21